---
---
<section id="features" class="bg-white py-20 lg:py-28">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">

    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16 reveal">
      <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#0067B8] uppercase tracking-widest mb-3 block">
        <span class="en">The Solution</span>
        <span class="ru">Решение</span>
      </span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-[#1B2A4A] leading-tight mb-4">
        <span class="en">AI HTR: A Revolution in<br/>Handwritten Text Recognition</span>
        <span class="ru">AI HTR: Революция в распознавании<br/>рукописного текста</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-[#6B7280] text-lg">
        <span class="en">An intelligent system that understands context — not just analyzes pixels.</span>
        <span class="ru">Интеллектуальная система, которая понимает контекст — а не просто анализирует пиксели.</span>
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Feature grid -->
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">

      <!-- Feature 1: Context Understanding -->
      <div class="bg-[#EBF2F8] rounded-2xl p-8 card-hover reveal reveal-delay-1">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-[#0067B8]/15 flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-[#0067B8]" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9.813 15.904L9 18.75l-.813-2.846a4.5 4.5 0 00-3.09-3.09L2.25 12l2.846-.813a4.5 4.5 0 003.09-3.09L9 5.25l.813 2.846a4.5 4.5 0 003.09 3.09L15.75 12l-2.846.813a4.5 4.5 0 00-3.09 3.09z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#1B2A4A] mb-3">
          <span class="en">Context Understanding</span>
          <span class="ru">Понимание контекста</span>
        </h3>
        <p class="text-[#6B7280] leading-relaxed">
          <span class="en">Unlike classic OCR, AI HTR doesn't just search for letter shapes — it analyzes the meaning of the text. This allows restoring damaged or illegible fragments, taking into account individual handwriting styles.</span>
          <span class="ru">В отличие от классических OCR, AI HTR не просто ищет формы букв — он анализирует смысл текста. Это позволяет восстанавливать повреждённые или неразборчивые фрагменты, учитывая индивидуальные особенности почерка.</span>
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 2: Hybrid Architecture -->
      <div class="bg-[#EBF2F8] rounded-2xl p-8 card-hover reveal reveal-delay-2">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-[#0067B8]/15 flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-[#0067B8]" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6.429 9.75L2.25 12l4.179 2.25m0-4.5l5.571 3 5.571-3m-11.142 0L2.25 7.5 12 2.25l9.75 5.25-4.179 2.25m0 0L21.75 12l-4.179 2.25m0 0l4.179 2.25L12 21.75 2.25 16.5l4.179-2.25m11.142 0l-5.571 3-5.571-3" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#1B2A4A] mb-3">
          <span class="en">Hybrid Architecture</span>
          <span class="ru">Гибридная архитектура</span>
        </h3>
        <p class="text-[#6B7280] leading-relaxed">
          <span class="en">Combines classical Computer Vision and Large Language Models (LLMs). Visual analysis of patterns at the pixel level is followed by linguistic verification of context and sentence structure.</span>
          <span class="ru">Объединяет классическое Computer Vision и Large Language Models (LLM). Визуальный анализ паттернов на уровне пикселей дополняется лингвистической проверкой контекста и структуры предложения.</span>
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 3: Accuracy -->
      <div class="bg-[#EBF2F8] rounded-2xl p-8 card-hover reveal reveal-delay-3">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-[#0067B8]/15 flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-[#0067B8]" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75L11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12c0 1.268-.63 2.39-1.593 3.068a3.745 3.745 0 01-1.043 3.296 3.745 3.745 0 01-3.296 1.043A3.745 3.745 0 0112 21c-1.268 0-2.39-.63-3.068-1.593a3.746 3.746 0 01-3.296-1.043 3.745 3.745 0 01-1.043-3.296A3.745 3.745 0 013 12c0-1.268.63-2.39 1.593-3.068a3.745 3.745 0 011.043-3.296 3.746 3.746 0 013.296-1.043A3.746 3.746 0 0112 3c1.268 0 2.39.63 3.068 1.593a3.746 3.746 0 013.296 1.043 3.746 3.746 0 011.043 3.296A3.745 3.745 0 0121 12z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#1B2A4A] mb-3">
          <span class="en">Up to 99% Accuracy and Beyond</span>
          <span class="ru">Точность до 99% и выше</span>
        </h3>
        <p class="text-[#6B7280] leading-relaxed">
          <span class="en">Recognition accuracy for complex handwriting and historical typefaces — including Gothic (Fraktur) — reaches 99% and above, where traditional solutions produce no usable results.</span>
          <span class="ru">Точность распознавания сложных рукописей и исторических шрифтов, включая готику (фрактуру), достигает 99% и выше — там, где традиционные решения не дают пригодных результатов.</span>
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 4: Ready Out of the Box -->
      <div class="bg-[#EBF2F8] rounded-2xl p-8 card-hover reveal reveal-delay-4">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-[#0067B8]/15 flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-[#0067B8]" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M21 7.5l-2.25-1.313M21 7.5v2.25m0-2.25l-2.25 1.313M3 7.5l2.25-1.313M3 7.5l2.25 1.313M3 7.5v2.25m9 3l2.25-1.313M12 12.75l-2.25-1.313M12 12.75V15m0 6.75l2.25-1.313M12 21.75V19.5m0 2.25l-2.25-1.313m0-16.875L12 2.25l2.25 1.313M12 4.5v2.25" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#1B2A4A] mb-3">
          <span class="en">Ready Out of the Box</span>
          <span class="ru">Готова «из коробки»</span>
        </h3>
        <p class="text-[#6B7280] leading-relaxed">
          <span class="en">The system is ready to work immediately after installation. No need to hire a team of Data Scientists or specialized AI engineers. No pre-training required.</span>
          <span class="ru">Система готова к работе сразу после установки. Не нужно нанимать штат Data Scientists или узкопрофильных ИИ-специалистов. Предварительного обучения не требуется.</span>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Extra features row -->
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mt-6">

      <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-[#0067B8] to-[#0055A0] rounded-2xl p-8 text-white card-hover reveal reveal-delay-1">
        <div class="text-3xl font-bold mb-1">40+</div>
        <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-white/80 mb-3">
          <span class="en">Languages</span>
          <span class="ru">Языков</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-white/70 text-sm">
          <span class="en">Modern scripts, historical languages (Latin, Ancient Greek, Old Slavonic), and mixed-language documents.</span>
          <span class="ru">Современные письменности, исторические языки (латынь, древнегреческий, старославянский) и смешанные документы.</span>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-[#EBF2F8] rounded-2xl p-8 card-hover reveal reveal-delay-2">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-[#0067B8]/15 flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-[#0067B8]" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3.75 6A2.25 2.25 0 016 3.75h2.25A2.25 2.25 0 0110.5 6v2.25a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25 2.25H6a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25-2.25V6zM3.75 15.75A2.25 2.25 0 016 13.5h2.25a2.25 2.25 0 012.25 2.25V18a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25 2.25H6A2.25 2.25 0 013.75 18v-2.25zM13.5 6a2.25 2.25 0 012.25-2.25H18A2.25 2.25 0 0120.25 6v2.25A2.25 2.25 0 0118 10.5h-2.25a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25-2.25V6zM13.5 15.75a2.25 2.25 0 012.25-2.25H18a2.25 2.25 0 012.25 2.25V18A2.25 2.25 0 0118 20.25h-2.25A2.25 2.25 0 0113.5 18v-2.25z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#1B2A4A] mb-2">
          <span class="en">Intelligent Segmentation</span>
          <span class="ru">Интеллектуальная сегментация</span>
        </h3>
        <p class="text-[#6B7280] text-sm">
          <span class="en">Automatic detection of columns, headings, and complex document layouts.</span>
          <span class="ru">Автоматическое определение колонок, заголовков и сложной верстки документов.</span>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-[#EBF2F8] rounded-2xl p-8 card-hover reveal reveal-delay-3">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-[#0067B8]/15 flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-[#0067B8]" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M10.5 6h9.75M10.5 6a1.5 1.5 0 11-3 0m3 0a1.5 1.5 0 10-3 0M3.75 6H7.5m3 12h9.75m-9.75 0a1.5 1.5 0 01-3 0m3 0a1.5 1.5 0 00-3 0m-3.75 0H7.5m9-6h3.75m-3.75 0a1.5 1.5 0 01-3 0m3 0a1.5 1.5 0 00-3 0m-9.75 0h9.75" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#1B2A4A] mb-2">
          <span class="en">Flexible Configuration</span>
          <span class="ru">Гибкая настройка</span>
        </h3>
        <p class="text-[#6B7280] text-sm">
          <span class="en">Prompt customization for each processing stage. Industry-specific adaptation for legal, medical, and religious documents.</span>
          <span class="ru">Кастомизация промптов для каждого этапа обработки. Отраслевая адаптация для юридических, медицинских и церковных документов.</span>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
